  "body": "Some opportunities are defined by location, others by potential. Here, the attraction is both.\r\n\r\nJust four properties back from Devonport Beach, this is an opportunity to secure a foothold in one of Auckland's most desirable coastal neighbourhoods. With a generous freehold site, an elevated position and scope to make your mark, the possibilities are well worth exploring.\r\n\r\nSet on 506sqm of freehold land, the property enjoys an established setting framed by mature greenery, with a sea outlook from the front lawn offering a reminder of just how close you are to the water. The existing home provides comfortable, single-level living and immediate functionality, while presenting an exciting opportunity to personalise, refresh or explore its future potential.\r\n\r\nThree bedrooms and two bathrooms are arranged across a practical, easy-flowing layout, offering a welcoming foundation for families, couples and downsizers alike. Light-filled interiors and established surroundings add to the appeal, while the opportunity to introduce your own style gives the next owner the freedom to shape a home that reflects their vision.\r\n\r\nThe landholding adds another compelling dimension. There is room to entertain, garden and enjoy the outdoors, with the elevated position offering scope to consider how the home might be further enhanced and better connected to its coastal outlook, subject to council approval. Existing plans are available upon request, providing a useful starting point for those wishing to explore the possibilities.\r\n\r\nThe setting is equally appealing. Devonport Beach, Torpedo Bay and Cheltenham Beach are all within easy reach, alongside waterfront walks, leafy reserves, boutique cafes and the village's established shopping and dining. Excellent schooling and the ferry connection to Auckland's CBD further reinforce the appeal. Morning beach walks, coffee in the village and an easy commute to the city can all become part of everyday life.\r\n\r\nWhether you are searching for a coastal home to enjoy, a renovation project with scope to add value, or a substantial freehold site in a premium position, this property deserves your attention. The combination of land, elevation, sea outlook and proximity to the waterfront is increasingly hard to find.\r\n\r\nOur VIDEO TOUR reveals the home's presence, natural light and flow, while the immersive 3D VIRTUAL TOUR allows you to explore every space and appreciate its proportions from wherever you are. Simply select the box icon to begin your virtual walkthrough. We encourage you to arrange an inspection, experience the position for yourself and request the available plans as you consider the possibilities.\r\n\r\nThere is no advantage in waiting for another opportunity to come along. If Devonport is on your radar, now is the time to inspect, complete your due diligence and position yourself ahead of auction day.\r\n\r\nMove in and enjoy, renovate and enhance, or explore what may be possible for the future. The choice is yours. The instruction is clear: this property is going to auction and will be sold.\r\n\r\nAn elevated coastal setting. A coveted Devonport position. Will you be taking the keys home?\r\n\r\nProudly marketed by The EK Group, delivering prestige, passion, and property without parallel.",
